  "justification": "TVDB 200971 holds the series as three seasons of 13 (39 episodes); AniDB lists 35 regular episodes and 4 specials. Season 3 carries the rest in AniDB's order: 27 Run, Steam Locomotive! = S3E1 Run! Locomotive, 28 Lullaby Plant of Love = S3E2, 30 and 31 The Adventure of the SS Dream Part One and Two = S3E4-5, 35 Bridge of Friendship = S3E9, then the specials S1 Sculptor of the Forest, S2 Hero's Hill, S3 Violin Singing to the Heart and S4 Good Night, Prince = S3E10-13 (1979-04-03 to 04-24). The first two rows already matched by the Japanese titles; 27-35 and the specials fell on missing episodes.",
